A variable declared without a value will automatically have the valueundefined.

You can usetypeofto check if a variable is undefined.

An empty string has a value and a type.

It is not the same asundefined.

Accessing a non-existing object property returnsundefined.

A function without a return value returnsundefined.

Objects can be emptied by setting the value toundefined.

Objects can also be emptied by setting the value tonull.

undefinedis a JavaScript value.

It means that a variable has been declared, but no value has been assigned.

### Code Snippets

